1
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:26,694
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,094 --> 00:00:33,709
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:40,720
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,058 --> 00:00:47,067
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,278 --> 00:00:51,199
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:54,501
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,798 --> 00:00:59,033
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:03,926
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:07,110
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:12,202
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,202 --> 00:01:16,782
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,782 --> 00:01:18,781
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,984 --> 00:01:24,766
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:29,461
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,461 --> 00:01:31,969
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,215 --> 00:01:42,432
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:48,716
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,716 --> 00:01:51,634
=Episode 12=

19
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:54,640
Xu Xian, just let me explain.

20
00:01:58,599 --> 00:02:01,400
Qing, you've messed things up.

21
00:02:05,692 --> 00:02:08,262
(Silk Shop)

22
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,599
Mr. Gu.

23
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,000
You're here.

24
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,080
I'm here for the fabrics.

25
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,879
What kind of material
are you looking for today?

26
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,360
Mr. Gu,

27
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:36,639
I want ten chi
of this bolt of red cloud brocade.

28
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,599
You've set your sights on this?

29
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:41,159
Any happy event coming?

30
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:42,479
It's still early,

31
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,120
but there are some signs.

32
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:46,439
I'm just planning ahead.

33
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:48,039
Mrs. Fang,

34
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:50,840
you and Constable Fang
have treated Xu Xian

35
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,199
like your own son all these years.

36
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:53,800
And your efforts have finally paid off.

37
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,919
Congratulations!

38
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,759
Miss Bai, you don't need
to wait by the door.

39
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,439
But I have to explain it to you.

40
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,960
Don't bother.

41
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:13,919
Do you misunderstand Qing?

42
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:17,080
I don't care about that.

43
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,479
But Qing really is just my bodyguard.

44
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,840
It's not what you think.

45
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,840
No need to explain.

46
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:25,639
You're nice, so it's only natural
some guys would like you.

47
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:38,199
Don't you think
Qing is exceptionally handsome?

48
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:43,000
I'm not interested in a man's looks.

49
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:45,400
But Qing is a girl.

50
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,280
Really?

51
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:53,520
I swear it's true.

52
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:57,719
Two girls traveling alone wasn't safe,

53
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:59,120
so she disguised herself as a man.

54
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,120
Qing.

55
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,240
We're going to be

56
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,560
best buddies

57
00:04:08,879 --> 00:04:10,039
forever.

58
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,399
Well, it tastes good

59
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:34,079
when you eat
the chicken and fish together.

60
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:36,720
Especially the shrimp.
I have to grab one.

61
00:04:38,199 --> 00:04:39,199
The chicken...

62
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:48,839
I just caught this
up in the hills today.

63
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:50,879
It is very fresh.

64
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,240
Try it.

65
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,680
It's good.

66
00:05:06,959 --> 00:05:08,000
The meat is so tender

67
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,480
and well-flavored.

68
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,279
I heard from Aunt

69
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:20,680
that you love steamed bass.

70
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:23,639
I went to Cuiyu Pavilion
early this morning just to get this.

71
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:25,279
Try it.

72
00:05:26,879 --> 00:05:27,879
Okay.

73
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:34,040
It looks like you two not only made up,

74
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,759
but also made great progress.

75
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:41,360
Stop that nonsense!

76
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,079
If you like it, then eat more.

77
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,959
Fine.

78
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:51,399
After all, this is the chicken
you caught up in the hills.

79
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:57,000
And this is the fish Miss Bai bought
early in the morning.

80
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,879
I owe you for this meal.

81
00:05:58,879 --> 00:06:00,000
I'll be quiet.

82
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,480
Xu Xian,

83
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:09,720
I have an idea
for Aunt's birthday gift this year.

84
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,000
What is it?

85
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:28,079
Qing, why are you only
eating plain rice today?

86
00:06:28,439 --> 00:06:30,000
Have some dishes, here.

87
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,560
This meat is delicious.

88
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:36,519
Eat up.

89
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:41,920
You should eat more.

90
00:06:57,120 --> 00:07:00,600
Listen, your face is longer
than a willow branch by the lake.

91
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,759
Do you want a man too?

92
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,079
Want me to help you?

93
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:14,759
Shut it. Even a meal
can't keep your mouth shut.

94
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,480
Just eat.

95
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,519
Qing,

96
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:57,079
do you want to pick out
a birthday gift for Aunt with me?

97
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,560
Qing, you look beautiful.

98
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,839
Suits you, right?

99
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,480
You look so beautiful.

100
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,160
Suzhen, let's go.

101
00:08:42,384 --> 00:08:45,451
(Silk Shop)

102
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:57,879
Suzhen.

103
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,600
You must be Qing.

104
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,840
Aunt.

105
00:09:03,399 --> 00:09:05,080
Miss Qing is pretty and charming.

106
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,759
To be honest,
I had my suspicions all along.

107
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:10,360
You should dress like this from now on.

108
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:11,879
You look so pretty.

109
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,320
Thank you, Aunt.

110
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:16,960
Aunt, we were just afraid
of being bullied on the road.

111
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,159
With Xu Xian around,
you won't be afraid anymore.

112
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:23,759
Wait here. I want to show you something.

113
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,240
Look at this fabric.

114
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:32,840
The color is so vibrant,

115
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:34,440
and it's so soft to the touch.

116
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,919
Perfect for you.

117
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:39,039
You can use it to make jackets and bibs

118
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,240
for your child later on.

119
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:45,799
Aunt, aren't we here
to pick a birthday gift for you?

120
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,159
Why are you picking
something out for me?

121
00:09:48,759 --> 00:09:49,919
It doesn't matter.

122
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,159
I've already celebrated
dozens of birthdays.

123
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:53,759
Let's not bother with this.

124
00:09:55,039 --> 00:09:58,879
Seeing you happily together
is all I want.

125
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:01,279
That's the best gift I want.

126
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:03,519
Aunt.

127
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:09,919
What do you want to have first,
a boy or a girl?

128
00:10:11,279 --> 00:10:13,080
I've even thought of a bunch of names.

129
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:16,279
For a boy, Xu Chengzhi.

130
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:18,919
For a girl, Xu Wanqing.

131
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,360
Do you like them?

132
00:10:20,879 --> 00:10:22,080
Aunt.

133
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,480
Isn't that Xu Xian?

134
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,399
Aunt, you must be seeing things.

135
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:39,360
Xu Xian is at home
setting up for your birthday.

136
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:40,600
He couldn't be out here.

137
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,639
You must miss him so much.

138
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:49,120
You're seeing him in everyone.

139
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,480
Uncle.

140
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:31,200
The most handsome head disciple.

141
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,480
Greetings.

142
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,480
Greetings, Mr. Fang.

143
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,480
We meet again.

144
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,279
Everything is in here?

145
00:11:43,399 --> 00:11:44,399
Wonderful.

146
00:11:45,039 --> 00:11:47,200
If Wenhui sees this,

147
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:50,399
I can't even imagine
how happy she'll be.

148
00:11:55,519 --> 00:11:58,840
Ever since your aunt married me,

149
00:12:00,279 --> 00:12:03,399
she's been busy with the housework
and taking care of you.

150
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,279
I don't even know when

151
00:12:06,519 --> 00:12:09,320
she just stopped having any time
to doll herself up.

152
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,960
Uncle.

153
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:14,399
Everything is fine now.

154
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,759
You're all grown up,

155
00:12:17,039 --> 00:12:19,840
so your aunt will have plenty of time

156
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:23,519
to doll herself up.

157
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,120
Uncle, this is all my fault.

158
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:31,919
Xu Xian, you mustn't
believe what outsiders say.

159
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,799
Your aunt didn't want a child of her own

160
00:12:33,799 --> 00:12:35,000
not just because of you.

161
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:39,000
It was a decision I made with your aunt.

162
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,559
It was our choice.

163
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:43,240
Your aunt

164
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:46,440
poured all her motherly love

165
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:49,960
into you.

166
00:12:52,159 --> 00:12:55,480
You are our child.

167
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,159
I understand, Uncle.

168
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:06,240
Good. Let's have some tea.

169
00:13:10,095 --> 00:13:13,194
(Longevity)

170
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:16,000
We'll have a big banquet tomorrow,

171
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:19,519
so let's have our own
family gathering today.

172
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:23,279
Come on, everyone sit down.

173
00:13:23,919 --> 00:13:25,279
Try my cooking.

174
00:13:25,639 --> 00:13:27,399
I made all of these.

175
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:36,879
My dear, I thought we agreed

176
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,159
to order dishes at Cuiyu Pavilion.

177
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,919
That's such a waste of money.

178
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,639
Well, let's just sit then. Sit.

179
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:52,200
Thank you for your hard work, my dear.

180
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,200
Take the seat of honor.

181
00:14:25,744 --> 00:14:29,903
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

182
00:14:32,370 --> 00:14:36,748
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

183
00:14:38,291 --> 00:14:44,116
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

184
00:14:44,885 --> 00:14:49,352
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

185
00:14:52,217 --> 00:14:56,658
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

186
00:14:58,854 --> 00:15:03,584
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

187
00:15:04,796 --> 00:15:10,909
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

188
00:15:11,572 --> 00:15:17,354
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

189
00:15:17,354 --> 00:15:23,617
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

190
00:15:23,927 --> 00:15:30,286
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

191
00:15:30,457 --> 00:15:37,824
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

192
00:15:38,109 --> 00:15:43,656
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

193
00:15:44,147 --> 00:15:50,357
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

194
00:15:50,667 --> 00:15:57,440
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

195
00:15:58,437 --> 00:16:04,090
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

196
00:16:04,924 --> 00:16:09,332
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

197
00:16:10,097 --> 00:16:12,685
♪Having ever loved♪
